            "category": "description",
            "text": "jquery prior to 1.9.0 allows Cross-site Scripting attacks via the load method. The load method fails to recognize and remove \"<script>\" HTML tags that contain a whitespace character, i.e: \"</script >\", which results in the enclosed script logic to be executed.",
